There's only one place they'd
go at a time like this.

36
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,840
Yeah, I know just the place.

37
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,560
Hey, Llamas and Boxo.

38
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,520
Karios, Garth.

39
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:25,460
Glad to see you guys made it
back safely. We've been busy.

40
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:26,777
Yeah, about that.

41
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:27,800
I saw the inn.

42
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:30,797
Now, before you go asking,
they're both all right.

43
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,817
Oh, what a relief.

44
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:35,220
This is where the transfer circle is.

45
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,694
It's the safest place.

46
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:37,930
Of course.

47
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,477
The village was built inside of a dungeon.

48
