It's only natural for it
to have all these defenses.

49
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,020
It's Lamy!

50
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,557
I thought I heard your voice.

51
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,470
You're okay.

52
00:03:47,553 --> 00:03:48,383
I was worried.

53
00:03:48,466 --> 00:03:51,017
We had quite the exciting
time while you were gone.

54
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:52,617
Did you guys finish the request?

55
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:53,530
Yep.

56
00:03:53,613 --> 00:03:54,537
It was a piece of cake.

57
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:55,980
Thank you very much.

58
